     "5f007d3c-c5ee-4d0d-a7be-dc1b78f60740"], Cell["\<\
Given points, a point can be laid off at a prescribed distance along the \
segment.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"4db7bccf-d77b-41eb-9115-89c648742214"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "4343e49c-51c0-49d8-817c-5337ffeea786"], Cell[
