Cell["\<\
The intensity in that picture is the multiplicity: an edge lying on many \
geodesics is drawn more strongly than one lying on few, so the bundle shows \
where the segment is concentrated.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"3ddde995-482d-42be-948f-28a322afdfab"],

Cell["The count-less call is one geodesic; a count gives a list.", \
"ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"d2695412-d700-4b65-9212-15a4e15145d2"],

